{"term": {"label": "道", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-ii", "title": "萬章下", "description": "孟子曰：「伯夷，目不視惡色，耳不聽惡聲。非其君不事，非其民不使。治則進，亂則退。橫政之所出，橫民之所止，不忍居也。思與鄉人處，如以朝衣朝冠坐於塗炭也。當紂之時，居北海之濱，以待天下之清也。故聞伯夷之風者，頑夫廉，懦夫有立志。\n「伊尹曰：『何事非君？何使非民？』治亦進，亂亦進。曰：『天之生斯民也，使先知覺後知，使先覺覺後", "occurrences": 12, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "云", "id": "云"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仕", "id": "仕"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "入", "id": "入"}, {"form": "出", "id": "出"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "問", "id": "問"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "坐", "id": "坐"}, {"form": "外", "id": "外"}, {"form": "朝", "id": "朝"}, {"form": "條理", "id": "條理"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "獵", "id": "獵"}, {"form": "禦", "id": "禦"}, {"form": "聽", "id": "聽"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}, {"form": "覺", "id": "覺"}, {"form": "較", "id": "較"}, {"form": "道", "variants": [], "id": "道"}, {"form": "門", "id": "門"}, {"form": "養", "id": "養"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.060749408667683, "source": "養", "target": "仕"}, {"weight": 3.159361697335793, "source": "養", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 1.6189166563886441, "source": "養", "target": "問"}, {"weight": 1.4853852637641216, "source": "養", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.3416832541297476, "source": "覺", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 2.466214516775848, "source": "覺", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.178532444324067, "source": "覺", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.3608540011180215, "source": "事", "target": "條理"}, {"weight": 2.0731719286662407, "source": "事", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.667706820558076, "source": "事", "target": "獵"}, {"weight": 1.667706820558076, "source": "事", "target": "較"}, {"weight": 1.4445632692438664, "source": "事", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 1.4445632692438664, "source": "事", "target": "云"}, {"weight": 1.2134515482804797, "source": "禦", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2